title Mine Field: the same old save on a screen whose Beginner is 9x9/10: it is read and resumed
sizes 800x480 480x800 640x480
env MINEFIELD_TEST_DATA s4-old-save-resumed
env MINEFIELD_TEST_RESET 1
env MINEFIELD_TEST_OLDSAVE 1
env MINEFIELD_TEST_DIMS 9x9x10,14x10x22,18x12x40

wait 400
expect text "Game resumed"
shot old-resumed
check old-resumed
